      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Brazil Tax Reform 2026: NCM to cClassTrib & NF-e Auditor Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nMaps Brazilian NCM product catalogs and audits NF-e XML invoices for the 2026 Tax Reform (LC 214/2025 - IBS, CBS, and Imposto Seletivo). Returns cClassTrib, CST, reduction percentages, legal annexes, and compliance alerts.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/brazil-tax-reform-ncm-classtrib-auditor](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/brazil-tax-reform-ncm-classtrib-auditor)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: brazil-tax-reform-ncm-classtrib-auditor** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "da98efa3-d980-5dbd-8655-c2b74416db58",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
